nt-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">price for Xcel Energy&#8217;s common stock during a period preceding settlement in December 2026, subject to a cap price and floor price derived from the September 2025 and December 2025 public offerings.</span></ix:footnote></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">If settled in physical shares, stockholders&#8217; equity equal to cash proceeds will be recorded at settlement.</span></div></div><div style="display:inline-block;max-width:3.174%;min-width:2.174%;vertical-align:top"></div><div style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:48.414%"><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The 2025 collared forward equity agreements cannot be settled until December 2026, and net cash settlement and net share settlement are generally unavailable. The 2025 forward equity agreements could have been settled at Dec. 31, 2025 with physical delivery of common shares to the banking counterparties in exchange for cash; if Xcel Energy unilaterally elected net cash or net share settlement, these agreements also could have been settled with delivery of cash or shares of common stock to the banking counterparties, as follows:</span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="xel:ProFormaHypotheticalTransactionsTableTextBlock" id="f-1165" escape="true"><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:22.397%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/>